WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
Here, everyone has a price.

2
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.070
Darcy: ten thousand a year.

3
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.340
Mr Bennet: two thousand.

4
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:11.200
Elizabeth: one thousand
pounds, once her mother dies.

5
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.240
And the Bennets' home is entailed.

6
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.650
It must pass to a male heir:
their cousin, Mr Collins.

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.930
Charlotte, aged twenty-seven,
accepts Mr Collins,

8
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.990
and explains: "I am
not romantic, you know.

9
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.270
I never was."

10
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.070
A comfortable home on one
side, the heart on the other.

11
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.620
Was she foolish, or wise?

12
00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.730
In this mission, you'll put
a figure on every character,

13
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.070
using the incomes the novel states.

14
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.990
You'll learn what an entail meant, and
ask what choices a woman in Charlotte's

15
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.810
position really had.

16
00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.890
And you'll read her
choice, phrase by phrase.

17
00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.970
Your mission: decide whether
Charlotte is foolish or wise.
